      "writtenOn": "2026-05-26T20:23:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This was introduced in https://crrev.com/c/7080810; you can see more details in that CL\u0027s commit message.\n\nThat said, each of these usages seem safe to use the double-evaluating uppercase Zephyr macros",
